- Lecture name.
- Subject or course name, if available.
- Start time.
- End time.
- Location or classroom, if available.
- Current status.
- Attendance status, when applicable.
- Remaining time or time until the lecture.

Possible lecture states:

A. UPCOMING
The lecture has not started.

Show the start time and a countdown when appropriate.

B. IN PROGRESS
The current time falls between the lecture's start and end times.

Clearly highlight the active lecture.

Display the remaining lecture time.

Show the attendance controls when attendance can still be recorded.

C. COMPLETED
The scheduled end time has passed.

Show the appropriate completion state and the recorded attendance result, if one exists.

D. MISSED
The lecture ended without attendance being recorded, according to the attendance rules defined below.

Clearly distinguish this from a lecture that the student attended.

E. CANCELLED
